ty"],["ARC or PLC in Union County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/union-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Union County record runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 June to July ran 193% of normal on the middle of the grids, while September to October managed 47%. The open year started low, with January to February 2026 at 9% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 27434 had its driest year in 1976 at 50%.</p>"}
